flowchart TD
    AlertApproved[Official Alert Disseminated] --> AutoTask[Generate Tactical Response Tasks]
    AutoTask --> AssignTeam[Assign Red Cross / Fire / Health Units by Proximity]
    AssignTeam --> TeamAck[Field Team Leader Acknowledges via Mobile App]
    TeamAck --> EnRoute[Team En-Route: GPS Telemetry Streamed]
    EnRoute --> OnScene[Arrival On-Scene: Search, Rescue & Medical Triage]
    OnScene --> TaskComplete[Field Commander Submits Debris/Casualty Report]
    TaskComplete --> Debrief[Debrief & Resource Restock]
